{"id": "16-63-2-10", "zh": "其次是过去条件式（kālātipatti）的变化形：issā、issaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-63-11-14", "zh": "isse、issatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-63-15-18", "zh": "issaṃ、issamhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-63-19-22", "zh": "issatha、issisu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-63-23-26", "zh": "issase、issavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-63-27-30", "zh": "issaṃ、issāmhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-63-31-51", "zh": "虽然属于过去条件式，又属于非一切词尾（asabbadhātuka），但因为词根是纯元音，所以得不到 a 音和 i 音的增音；或者说，因为这一规则不是必然适用的，而且在这里不合理，所以不加 a 音增音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-63-52-57", "zh": "因为在这里，两个紧挨着的纯元音碰在一起是不合理的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-63-58-60", "zh": "过去条件式的规则讲完了。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-64-2-52", "zh": "不过，在这个地方，为了让听闻三藏佛语及其义注的人在用法和意义上生起最高的善巧，我们依据圣典中“婆罗门啊，当有人说‘诸天不会嫉妒人的努力’时，你难道没有听到吗”这句话取得方法，来说明那些与上述未来时变化形完全相同、意义却不同的现在时变化形，以及彼此略有相似的未来时和过去条件式的变化形。首先就现在时来说：“issati、issanti。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-64-53-61", "zh": "issasi、issatha”，全部都应这样配列。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-64-62-72", "zh": "不过，意义应当用“产生嫉妒”等说法来表达。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-64-73-81", "zh": "就同一个意义按未来时来说：“ississati、ississanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-64-82-90", "zh": "ississasi、ississatha”，应当完整地配列。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-64-91-101", "zh": "不过，意义应当用“将会产生嫉妒”等说法来表达。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-64-102-109", "zh": "按过去条件式来说：“ississā、ississaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-64-110-129", "zh": "ississe、ississatha”，应当完整地配列；不过，意义应当用“本来会产生嫉妒”等说法来表达。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-64-130-132", "zh": "这是借助其他词根进行对照的方法。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-65-2-6", "zh": "现在讲述 e 音之后紧接 ti 词尾的词的变化次序：", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-66-2-5", "zh": "eti、enti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-66-6-9", "zh": "esi、etha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-66-10-13", "zh": "emi、ema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-67-2-5", "zh": "etu、entu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-67-6-9", "zh": "ehi、etha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-67-10-13", "zh": "emi、ema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-68-2-10", "zh": "在没有到达苦的尽头之前，智者不应陷入安心松懈；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-69-2-7", "zh": "为有名望的毗提诃王建好住所之后，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-70-2-9", "zh": "等我派人去请你的时候，刹帝利啊，那时你再来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-71-2-6", "zh": "eyya、eyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-71-7-10", "zh": "eyyāsi、eyyātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-71-11-14", "zh": "eyyāmi、eyyāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-71-15-18", "zh": "etha、eraṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-71-19-22", "zh": "etho、eyyāvho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-71-23-26", "zh": "eyyaṃ、eyyāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-72-2-8", "zh": "那个人 eyya（会去），他们 eyyuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-72-9-14", "zh": "你 eyyāsi，你们 eyyātha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-72-15-20", "zh": "我 eyyāmi，我们 eyyāma。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-72-21-27", "zh": "那个人 etha，他们 eraṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-72-28-33", "zh": "你 etho，你们 eyyāvho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-72-34-39", "zh": "我 eyyaṃ，我们 eyyāmhe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-73-2-5", "zh": "完成时、昨天过去时和不定过去时的变化形完全不通行。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-74-2-5", "zh": "essati、essanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-74-6-9", "zh": "essasi、essatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-74-10-13", "zh": "essāmi、essāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-74-14-17", "zh": "essate、essante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-74-18-21", "zh": "essase、essavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-74-22-25", "zh": "essaṃ、essāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-75-2-7", "zh": "鸟儿们和睦相处时，就带着网一起飞走；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-76-2-10", "zh": "等到它们互相争吵的时候，就会落入我的掌控。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-77-2-14", "zh": "由于见到“abhidosagato idāni ehi”（过了昨夜，你如今才会来）这样的说法，其他的未来时变化形也应当采纳。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-78-2-5", "zh": "ehiti、ehinti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-78-6-9", "zh": "ehisi、ehitha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-78-10-13", "zh": "ehimi、ehima。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-78-14-17", "zh": "ehite、ehinte。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-78-18-21", "zh": "ehise、ehivhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-78-22-25", "zh": "ehissaṃ、ehissāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-2-5", "zh": "essā、essaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-6-9", "zh": "esse、essatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-10-12", "zh": "essaṃ、essāmhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-13-16", "zh": "essatha、essisu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-17-20", "zh": "essase、essavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-79-21-24", "zh": "essiṃ、essāmhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-80-2-6", "zh": "此外，还有另一种 e 音之后紧接 ti 词尾的词的变化次序：", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-81-2-5", "zh": "udeti、udenti；", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-81-6-9", "zh": "udesi、udetha；", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-81-10-13", "zh": "udemi、udema。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-82-2-5", "zh": "udetu、udentu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-82-6-9", "zh": "udehi、udetha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-82-10-15", "zh": "udemi、udema、udāmase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-83-2-5", "zh": "udeyya、udeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-83-6-8", "zh": "其余的可以依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-83-9-12", "zh": "udissati、udissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-83-13-15", "zh": "其余的可以依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-83-16-19", "zh": "udissā、udissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-83-20-22", "zh": "其余的可以依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-84-2-4", "zh": "以上是纯元音词根的变化形。", "confidence": 85}
